# Groq API key — powers resume analysis, LLM job judging, skill-gap parsing & the agent.
# Get one at https://console.groq.com/keys  (free tier is fine).
# The smallest GPT-OSS family model hosted by Groq is openai/gpt-oss-20b.
GROQ_API_KEY=

# Optional: pick a different Groq model (e.g. openai/gpt-oss-120b).
# GROQ_MODEL=openai/gpt-oss-20b

# Optional: override the job scraper's outbound timeout in ms.
# SCRAPE_TIMEOUT_MS=15000